  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue: \n\nSetting the Personal Mirror to Immersive Mode replaces the normal Pickup with a Raycast / Laser. The problem with this mode is that it blocks you from selecting the Player Capsule of other Users who are in front of your mirror.\n\n**Reproduction Steps:** \n\n1. Turn on your Personal Mirror \n\n2. Set the Personal Mirror to Immersive Mode  \n\n3. Place the Mirror behind another User  \n\n4. Open your Quick Menu\n\n5. Try to select the User who is standing in front of your Personal Mirror\n\nIf you do this you will notice that you cannot select the User.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nPlayer Capsules should always have a higher priority than the Personal Mirror. \n\nWhile I can see this being annoying when trying to grab the Personal Mirror, I do think that the ability to select other Users / Players is more important.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/0dzixl.mp4",
